														</div>
			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-1142258">
									

<p>A similar gag was used in one episode of <em>Star Trek: the Next Generation</em>, when Dr. Crusher was caught up in one of her son's warp-physics experiments.</p>
<p>That said, I think it's really well-done here. The fact that the subject's memories change, so that he never remembers that those other people used to be there&#8230; It hits my own fear of not being able to trust my own brain. I like it. I like it a lot.</p>

